  "title": "Simple Pan-Fried Tofu",
  "description": "This tasty vegetarian pan-fried tofu recipe is made with just 3 main ingredients: extra-firm tofu, green onions, and soy sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "The Cow"
  ],
  "date_published": "2016-04-27T20:24:56-04:00",
